  "_quality": "2026-10-24: a broad tapered muzzle (mammals.js: a muzzle of two ends is a tapered pill), sturdier legs with a full thigh, horns out to the sides, an udder with teats on the grown (`grown`: false on a calf, species.js makeYoung)",
  "print": "cloven",
  "sculpt": {
    "_about": "THE COW (2026-11-05): a dairy cow -- a long deep barrel on a straight back, sharp withers, the angular hip bones (hooks) and pin bones and the tail head over a flat rump, thin quarters, a low round belly; a short deep neck with its dewlap; a broad flat forehead under the poll, the eyes high on its corners, a long face to a broad wet pink muzzle, big round jaws, the ears straight out under the horns; stout legs with the knee, short cannons, dewclaws, two broad toes; piebald patches over it all (the solid pattern, in the rest pose's space); the horns, the udder and the tufted tail kept (2026-11-08) The HORNS are the engine's sharp `horn` (sharp.js; tools/creaturegen/sharp/horns.py merged the field part and its slender detail tip into one centreline): smooth, sunk in the skull, a true point. (2026-11-08, ears2.py) The EARS (ears2.py): broad LEAVES held out sideways (sharp.js `fin`), the hollow forward and down; the roots faired. (2026-11-08, tools/creaturegen/sweep/tails.py) The TAIL is one `sweep` (sculpt.js) along its bones, not a chain of cones blended one into the next: no beads, its thin end exact rings.",
